  # Shp (NR0B2 repressor), Klb/Fgfr4/Fgf19/Fxr - Hsd3b7 is the SDR family enzyme
  # that oxidizes the 3beta-OH and isomerizes Delta5->Delta4 on C27 sterol BA precursors.
