  # Distinct from Akr1d1 (5b-reductase), Hsd3b7 (3b-HSD/Delta5-4), Cyp8b1
  # (12a-hydroxylase), Cyp7a1 - Akr1c4 is the aldo-keto reductase that installs
  # the 3a-OH on 5b-cholestan-3-one BA precursors.
